{"id":"ed71f39f59370734","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-group.md","title":"Group","display":"df-group — Group","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-group","aliases":["58-df-group","Group"],"display":"df-group — Group","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-group"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-group</span><span>Group</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-group — Group"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,\\cdot\\in V\">\\(G,\\cdot\\in V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(\\cdot,G\\times G,G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(\\cdot,G\\times G,G)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Group}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Group}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}group} \\vdash \\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(\\cdot,G\\times G,G)\\land\\bigl(\\forall a,b,c\\in G\\;((a\\cdot b)\\cdot c=a\\cdot(b\\cdot c))\\bigr)\\land\\exists e\\in G\\;\\bigl(\\forall a\\in G\\;(e\\cdot a=a\\land a\\cdot e=a)\\land\\forall a\\in G\\;\\exists b\\in G\\;(a\\cdot b=e\\land b\\cdot a=e)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}group} \\vdash \\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(\\cdot,G\\times G,G)\\land\\bigl(\\forall a,b,c\\in G\\;((a\\cdot b)\\cdot c=a\\cdot(b\\cdot c))\\bigr)\\land\\exists e\\in G\\;\\bigl(\\forall a\\in G\\;(e\\cdot a=a\\land a\\cdot e=a)\\land\\forall a\\in G\\;\\exists b\\in G\\;(a\\cdot b=e\\land b\\cdot a=e)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Group: set with associative binary operation, identity, inverses</li>\n<li>Abelian: commutative group</li>\n<li>Order: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|G|\">\\(|G|\\)</span>, finite or infinite</li>\n<li>Examples: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{Z}, \\mathbb{R}^*, S_n, GL_n(\\mathbb{R})\">\\(\\mathbb{Z}, \\mathbb{R}^*, S_n, GL_n(\\mathbb{R})\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Dummit and Foote, Abstract Algebra</li>\n<li>Hungerford, Algebra</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G,\\cdot\\in V$, $\\mathrm{Function}(\\cdot,G\\times G,G)$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G,\\cdot\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(\\cdot,G\\times G,G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Group}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false}